WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.120
Banda Terrace

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.160
An... interview?

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:11.910
Yuko

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:11.910
Yeah. It's my homework, I have to write a report
on my neighborhood and the people in it.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.370
I wanted to start by interviewing
the older sister I'm so proud of!

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:16.830
Yuko's Sister - Ryoko

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:16.830
N-no way...

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:20.870
I'm just a helpless high schooler
who suddenly awakened to the powers of darkness.

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:25.620
I don't think there's anything about me
that you can be proud of, Ryo.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.540
Don't worry about that.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:31.370
I'm really good at exaggerating the stories I write about.

00:00:31.370 --> 00:00:34.450
You're really the best little sister I could ask for, Ryo!

00:00:34.620 --> 00:00:36.120
Yes,
yes

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:36.370
Yes, yes.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:37.080
She is such a reliable daughter.

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:38.040
Yuko's Mother
Seiko

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:51.580
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:54.540
Taiyou mabushisugite

00:00:54.620 --> 00:00:57.370
(Chikachika me o kosutta)

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.290
Omowazu tobidashita yo

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.870
(Dokidoki no hajimiari sa)

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:08.620
Yurayura yureru maegami hidarite de osaetara

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:13.200
Itsumo no keshiki ga kirameku yo

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:14.410
(Three, two, one)

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:19.450
Ima sugu tsutaetai futari no himitsu

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:25.950
Watashitachi nara dekiru yo

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.950
(Itsumo tonari ni ite)

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.120
Kitto

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.620
(Shijiteru kara)

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:34.580
Machikado de mitsuketa daiji na takaramono

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:40.370
Tatoe kimi ga tooku hanaretemo kanarazu oikakeru yo

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:46.500
Zutto kagayaiteru mirai wa koko ni aru

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:51.700
Otanoshimi wa kore kara

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:13.000
A Town Full of Traps??
The Demon on the Brink Awakens a New Ability

00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:16.790
I still have a lot to learn as a Demon Girl!

00:02:17.120 --> 00:02:21.500
I have to try my hardest to become someone
that Ryo can truly be proud of!

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:23.410
CLENCH

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.790
Tremble, Magical Girl...
for I'm finally about to put an end to you!

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:32.500
Hey, Shamiko. Good afternoon.

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:33.620
Good afternoon.

00:02:34.080 --> 00:02:37.830
I'm going to repay my debt to you all at once
with this $20 I earned from my job!

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:42.120
Now there is zero debt between the forces of light and
dark! And we can battle without holding anything back!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.000
That's right, you were selling wieners the other day.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.620
I actually have some of the ones
I bought with me right now.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:50.080
Are all of those supposed to be your lunch?!

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.750
Did you want to have some, Shamiko?

00:02:52.790 --> 00:02:54.540
I'd love to, but I will refrain!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.580
Shake
Shake

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.540
Enough! Take the money! And let's battle!

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:05.500
Uh, you know I'd really hate
to just take all of your hard-earned money.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.540
Why don't you use some of it for yourself, instead?

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:12.950
SHAMIKO'S FIRST PAYDAY
CONGRATULATORY AWARD

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:10.120
Don't you want to make a trophy or something
to commemorate the occasion?

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:16.790
You've earned a trophy!
"It's raining octopuses" (Bronze)

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.160
Trophy...

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:16.790
I can't spend money on something
so extravagant that has no edible parts!

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:20.370
Then would you settle for a trophy made entirely of ham?

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.120
Gulp.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:25.700
There would be nothing left if I eat it!
That's just barely unacceptable!

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:28.500
You won't be able to trick me with any food this time!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.330
Because I made sure to fill my stomach
before I came to challenge you!

00:03:32.660 --> 00:03:33.700
Burp.

00:03:33.870 --> 00:03:35.870
You're prepared for everything, huh?

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:41.370
I'll pay off my debt early and then take the next step
on the Demon path by undoing the seal!

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:43.120
I see...

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:45.830
Ah! I see you're conflicted about all this, Momo!

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.040
I'm not conflicted at all.

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:49.160
You gave it away by how you're acting!

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.200
I didn't give anything away.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.120
This is my fist victory!

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:54.870
I did it! I really did it!

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.250
THAT'S COLD!

00:03:57.370 --> 00:03:59.370
I-I'm... fweezing...

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:02.160
What's happening, what is this?

00:04:02.830 --> 00:04:05.830
It's my frozen water bottle... it's cold, huh?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:09.790
Excuse me, I got a little carried away. I apologize!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:16.040
Anyway, even if I pay you back,
I'll still be left with some change.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:19.500
So I'm going to buy my little sister
something special after school today.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:21.000
"Little sister"?

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:24.870
What's wrong?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.500
I can't go along with this.
I reject your request to settle the debt now.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.870
Let's continue with the 50-cent payment plan.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:34.290
Use whatever is left over each month
on yourself and your family.

00:04:34.410 --> 00:04:35.750
I won't accept anything else.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:36.830
What's gotten into you all of a sudden?!

00:04:36.830 --> 00:04:39.700
If you agree right now, I'll throw in
a free slice of bread. What do you say?

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:44.580
Too thin! I already told you,
you won't win me over with food today!

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:47.200
Plop. Plop.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.290
Anyway, I've been wondering...

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:52.330
That lunch of yours looks so hastily prepared,
with the uncooked wieners and untoasted bread.

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:54.580
Is your family just really busy or something?

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:56.290
I make my own lunch.

00:04:56.830 --> 00:04:58.830
Oh, do you live all by yourself?

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.540
I don't have any family...

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.080
Um...

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:07.000
I've said too much, just forget it.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:12.370
I'll take your thin bread!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:15.410
Just this once, I'll go along with whatever you say!

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:16.000
Huh?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.950
But this won't work on me ever again
unless you bring thicker slices of bread!

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.700
Tama Sakura Shopping District

00:05:23.870 --> 00:05:24.790
So...

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:30.540
Tama Sakura Shopping District

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:28.450
Why are you following me to the spot
where I'm meeting with my sister?

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:30.540
Am I not allowed to come with you?

00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:34.410
I thought you agreed to go along with whatever I said?

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:36.290
Just how underhanded can you get?!

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:38.250
Sis!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.830
Oh crap, here she comes!

00:05:40.330 --> 00:05:42.370
Just don't reveal your true identity!

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:45.660
I told her that the Magical Girl and I
are always engaged in fierce combat!

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:46.830
So, please!

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:48.750
You heaped it on extra thick, huh?

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.660
Not extra thick, just regular thick!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.700
You beat me here, Sis?

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.080
Ryoko! You didn't go home first to drop off your bags?

00:05:57.580 --> 00:05:59.620
I was doing my homework at the library.

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:01.950
Of course, you've always had
a good head on your shoulders!

00:06:02.330 --> 00:06:03.620
Who is this?

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:04.500
This is...

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:06.790
My best friend, Momo!

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.700
Don't look so surprised about it!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.250
Follow along!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.120
O-okay...

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.330
Nice to meet you, I'm Momo Chiyoda.

00:06:17.330 --> 00:06:19.450
I'm Ryoko, nice to meet you.

00:06:21.540 --> 00:06:23.000
I called you here today...

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.870
...to buy you a present
with the money I earned from my job!

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:30.000
Huh? You shouldn't... really...

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:35.370
Mom told me that the battle you're waging right now
is of the utmost importance.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.290
That's why I'm okay without getting anything.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:42.660
I want you to buy something useful for yourself.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.080
You shouldn't hold back like that!

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:46.500
Choose anything you like!

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:50.910
Then...

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.080
Some bandages and this "Household Medicine" book.

00:06:52.450 --> 00:07:01.120
HOUSEHOLD MEDICINE

00:06:55.580 --> 00:06:57.620
I'm not going to get hurt, don't worry!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.330
You don't have to become a combat medic just for me!

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:01.120
Then...

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:15.080
SIX SECRET
TEACHINGS

00:07:02.580 --> 00:07:04.080
The Art of War...

00:07:04.250 --> 00:07:11.870
"New Edition of the Six Secret Teachings:
Learn the art of war to become a superb military leader."

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:15.040
You realize that I don't actually control an army, right?!

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:19.910
Let's look around for a bit
and give you a chance to think it over.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:20.910
Okay...

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:26.290
Hamburg
Steak

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.540
Come on Momo, you, too!

00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:32.040
Ryoko, just think about what you want to do
or find something you want to own.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:35.290
Right...

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:46.450
Hey, Sis.

00:07:47.620 --> 00:07:48.200
I...

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:54.200
SUPER EXPANDING
SEAWEED

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:51.370
I want to make the economic choice and buy seaweed.
We'll get more for our money that way.

00:07:51.370 --> 00:07:54.200
Don't let yourself be swayed
by our family's nutritional needs!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:57.700
Shamiko.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.450
Wave
Wave

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:02.830
What about... that?

00:08:05.450 --> 00:08:09.790
WE BUY
AND SELL
CAMERAS

00:08:05.790 --> 00:08:09.540
Ever since we got here, Ryo's been looking at that
out of the corner of her eye.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.290
USB Toy Camera
Hot item

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.250
A mini-camera?

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:17.790
2,138 yen
($21.38)

00:08:13.950 --> 00:08:15.290
"Toy camera"?

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.790
Ryo, is this what you want?

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:20.040
No... I was just looking!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:23.200
I just thought it was really cute because of how tiny it is!

00:08:23.200 --> 00:08:26.500
Because at the library I'm always looking
at camera magazines and stuff!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.540
My eye was just drawn to it, that's all!

00:08:28.540 --> 00:08:31.200
You're seriously jonesing for it!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:36.870
2,138 yen
($21.38)
Hot item
USB Toy Camera

00:08:31.580 --> 00:08:34.330
But... it's expensive.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:35.830
I can do this!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.330
This is like chump change to me!

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:40.620
Let's buy it!

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:43.370
Then you can use it to take some glamorous shots
of your heroic sister!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.870
Sis... Thank you...

00:08:46.160 --> 00:08:47.580
Why are you crying?!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:57.250
Sniffle
Sniffle

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:55.500
Sniffle, sniffle... Sniffle, sniffle...

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:53.500
Because lately it's easy to tell whenever
you push yourself, since your tail goes really limp.

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.500
Huh? Is that true?

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.290
You never noticed it, huh?

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:57.290
Sniffle, sniffle...

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.750
WORRIED

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:58.750
Worried.

00:08:58.750 --> 00:09:00.250
UNMOTIVATED

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.250
Unmotivated.

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:01.750
NERVOUS

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:01.620
Nervous.

00:09:01.750 --> 00:09:03.290
EXCITED

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.040
Excited.

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.950
And right now, your tail is...

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:10.700
"Just how much has this person been observing me?
It's freaking me out!" Or something like that?

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:12.160
How can you read me like a book?!

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:16.750
Um, Momo...

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.120
Huh?

00:09:18.290 --> 00:09:23.290
I know that earlier at school I told you
it's best if I paid off my debt ASAP.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:29.410
But today, when I saw Ryoko's face like that...
I'm glad I was able to do something for her instead.

00:09:30.830 --> 00:09:31.660
Yeah.

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:35.250
I will definitely take my time and pay you back in full.

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:36.910
Okay.

00:09:36.910 --> 00:09:38.040
Since otherwise...

00:09:38.410 --> 00:09:40.700
...I'll never be able to fight you!

00:09:40.700 --> 00:09:43.700
You just wait and keep your blood sugar level
as high as it can get!

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.410
Uh, sure.

00:09:50.410 --> 00:09:52.120
Don't you have a better reply than that?!

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.040
Um...

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:53.750
Huh?

00:09:54.370 --> 00:09:58.410
The first picture I take should be special,
I want it to be of you two together.

00:09:58.750 --> 00:09:59.580
Wha-?!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.620
No, no, that won't be-

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:03.040
Aren't you best friends?

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:08.290
Well, we really have to consider
Momo's feelings in all this....

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:11.040
I don't mind at all.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.410
Hold on, Momo!

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:16.370
Let's go find a stool or something
Shamiko can step on to make her taller.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.700
There was one in front of the bookstore earlier.

00:10:18.700 --> 00:10:20.580
That works! Let's head there.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.500
So, is "Shamiko" my sister's nickname?

00:10:22.540 --> 00:10:26.120
You two don't need to put any more thought
into my height, thank you very much!

00:10:26.580 --> 00:10:28.580
A short time later...

00:10:28.830 --> 00:10:30.620
Okay, say cheese.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:38.700
I wonder how you develop the pictures on this...

00:10:38.700 --> 00:10:40.370
It must have film of some kind.

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:42.370
Let me see.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:47.620
This camera should be able
to print pictures on a computer via USB.

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:49.250
"US"...?

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:58.700
Wh-wha-what? Wh-wha-what...?

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:54.370
This isn't good... I don't even have a passport...

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:56.540
If I could at least swim and knew English then...

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:58.700
You're thinking about the "USA."

00:10:59.160 --> 00:11:03.290
I have a printer at home, so if you'll
lend me your camera then I'll print the picture out.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.660
Thank you very much!

00:11:06.250 --> 00:11:09.950
Are you good with computers, Ms. Momo?
Like with software and such.

00:11:10.200 --> 00:11:12.200
If it's a free version, I should have it yeah.

00:11:13.830 --> 00:11:15.120
"Free"...?

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:19.540
Th-Then, maybe you can do
some color corrections on the picture too?

00:11:19.540 --> 00:11:22.250
Oh, you're interested in retouching.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:27.250
If it's just a few simple things sure, but if you want
to do it right then a pen tablet is necessary.

00:11:27.250 --> 00:11:29.000
What's a "pen tablet"?

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:32.660
"Retouch"...? "Pen tablet"...?

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.620
Dizzy, dizzy.

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.000
Don't think this means you've won!

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:39.450
But please teach her more later!

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:41.200
Don't give up, Shamiko!

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:45.620
Make use of the school's computer lab
and become a great demon capable of IT support!

00:11:57.700 --> 00:11:59.370
Shamiko! Are you heading home now?

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.700
Here, take this with you.

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.950
It weighs a ton! What the heck is this?

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.620
It's my old laptop. I was thinking I'd let you borrow it.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:08.540
Why?!

00:12:08.830 --> 00:12:11.160
Because it looks like you could use some extra weight.

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:13.500
I'm not asking why you're making me hold it!

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:15.910
Actually, where's that Ancestue of yours?

00:12:15.910 --> 00:12:18.250
I forgot it at home today.

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:20.910
But I thought it was an important item to you?

00:12:20.910 --> 00:12:24.330
That's right. I definitely won't forget to bring it tomorrow.

00:12:25.830 --> 00:12:27.790
You know, I can't bring this laptop home with me!

00:12:27.790 --> 00:12:29.830
I've already borrowed more than enough from you!

00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:32.790
But I want Ryo to be able to use it.

00:12:32.790 --> 00:12:33.620
It's for Ryoko?

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:37.540
I saw the picture Ryo took and I think
she has a good sense for photography.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.450
It would be best for her future if she learned
how to operate a computer like this.

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.000
Thank you very much.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:49.950
Sure, I already installed some graphic software
and it also has the most recent OS that's available.

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.040
"OH... ES...?"

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:51.500
Oh yes!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:13:00.120
Oh yes! Oh yes! You can do it! You can do it!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.000
Oh yes!

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:52.500
Oh yes!

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:56.080
I guess for these older laptops you need
a special voice command to activate them, huh?

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:53.000
Oh yes!

00:12:55.250 --> 00:12:55.750
Oh yes!

00:12:55.750 --> 00:12:56.250
Oh yes!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:56.750
Oh yes!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:13:00.120
Should we chant along with it,
like when you root for the home team?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:57.250
Oh yes!

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:00.000
Oh yes!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:00.500
Oh yes!

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:02.040
Oh yes! Oh ye-!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.000
Oh yes!

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.040
You're thinking of "Oh yes."

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:01.500
Oh yes!

00:13:01.500 --> 00:13:02.040
Oh yes!

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:06.790
I'm going to be straight with you, Shamiko.
This laptop is a delicate piece of equipment.

00:13:07.160 --> 00:13:12.580
That means if you throw balls at it,
dump water on it, or drop it, then it will break easily.

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.950
You have to be careful with it.

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.080
Gulp.

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:18.750
Speaking of which,
how much does this laptop cost anyway?

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:19.620
That's a secret.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.700
Don't drop it, okay?

00:13:22.700 --> 00:13:27.160
No matter what, don't drop it.
Is that clear? I'm being serious.

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:29.500
You're enjoying this, I just know it!

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:32.540
CHALLENGE 1

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:32.540
SLIP PAST THE SCHOOL CLUBROOM BUILDING

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:35.000
Right now, I am a....

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.200
...delivery demon.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.080
My duty is to bring this delicate device
back to my home safely with no problems.

00:13:41.330 --> 00:13:42.910
Do your best, Sis!

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:47.040
For my darling little sister waiting at home,
I have to do my best!

00:13:47.910 --> 00:13:48.660
Gulp.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.750
The hallway feels much wider and longer
than it normally does...

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:54.870
Everyone... looks like an enemy!

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:02.040
Wassup?

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:04.040
WHAT THE FUWAH?!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.450
A-Anri, what are you doing?!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:09.160
I was trying to get your attention.

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:11.790
Am I not allowed to play a little prank on my good friend?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.450
Just for today please hold off on the pranks!

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.500
What the heck do you think
you're playing with over there?!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:23.000
Balls, duh! We have a match
against one of the top-seeded schools soon!

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:24.250
I'm gonna put my all into it!

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:28.000
O-oh God, please stop. No more balls.

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:29.830
It will... it will break...

00:14:29.830 --> 00:14:31.000
Are you afraid of balls?

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:32.450
They're just like bullets!

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:36.080
You think? Is my handling
of the racket really that impressive?

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:37.750
That makes me so happy to hear!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:43.160
Just wait, I've got a little trick that will smash a ball
right through anything with a "whoosh"!

00:14:43.160 --> 00:14:45.250
What are you, a hired assassin?!

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:48.200
THE SECOND ASSASSIN

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:48.200
SION OGURA ON CLEANING DUTY

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:49.330
Sigh.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:51.540
S-somehow, I managed to survive that mess.

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.660
Oh, Shamiko!

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:57.410
Oh, you're Ms. Ogura. One of Anri's friends from Class C!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:02.000
OH GOD, NOT A BUCKET!

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.950
I've always wanted to have a close
and personal chat with you, Shamiko!

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.950
I don't think that needs to be right now!

00:15:08.950 --> 00:15:12.250
Actually, I'm trying to create a research group
that focuses on magic and demons.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:14.790
I believe that what we discover
will definitely be of some use to you, Shamiko!

00:15:14.950 --> 00:15:19.330
You'd make a great subject... I mean,
this would be a great chance for us to become friends!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.370
So, if you ever are having trouble with anything,
then please let me know! Literally anything!

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:23.620
Come chat with me!

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:27.120
I get it already, just leave that water on the ground!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:28.250
Of course.

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:27.950
Clunk

00:15:28.540 --> 00:15:30.790
Ah, as proof of our new friendship...

00:15:31.700 --> 00:15:32.910
Here, take this.

00:15:33.950 --> 00:15:35.120
Gulp.

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.410
Wh-what is this, exactly?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.000
It's kind of tasty.

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:43.160
It's an original elixir I made
that's designed to boost magic power.

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:48.500
I wanted to let you test... I mean I wanted to give it to you
as a present, Shamiko. I've always kept it handy.

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:49.290
"Always"?

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:51.330
What is it made of?

00:15:51.330 --> 00:15:54.450
Habu, Ge Jie, Yartsa Gunbu, and some other stuff.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.830
If you want to know more,
you should do an image search of those later.

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:57.750
Okay.

00:15:57.750 --> 00:15:59.830
It seems like you enjoyed it,
so I'll make some more, okay?

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:02.830
LAST BATTLE?

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:06.540
I finally made it out of the school.

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:08.540
Just a little further, Sis!

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:11.000
Right! Just watch, Big Sis will do her best!

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:15.040
For now, I need to remain vigilant and watch out
for cars making a left turn on my way...

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:16.000
Ah!

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:18.120
That dog!

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.830
The whole reason I became indebted to Momo
in the first place was all because...

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:29.830
...of that barking dog!

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:31.200
Gulp.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:32.790
This is today's...

00:16:35.080 --> 00:16:36.500
...last battle!

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.410
Maybe I should just wait until the dog falls asleep?

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:46.160
No... my arms will get sore
and I'll drop the laptop before then.

00:16:46.330 --> 00:16:48.040
Should I fight it?

00:16:48.200 --> 00:16:49.910
No, I'd feel terrible!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:52.250
And actually, aren't dogs super strong?

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.700
I mean, they have FOUR legs!

00:16:54.700 --> 00:16:57.330
But the reality is I can't get home without crossing here.

00:16:57.370 --> 00:17:00.830
This is how the dog appears to Yuko

00:16:58.790 --> 00:16:59.830
What a pickle...

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:03.000
I'm gonna lose for sure!

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:07.000
The dog will bark at me, I'll fall,
smash the computer to bits,

00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:12.080
and then it'll snowball even worse
by getting this borrowed uniform all dirty!

00:17:12.540 --> 00:17:14.910
Oh, my poor little descendant...

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.790
Can you hear me?

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:17.580
Huh?

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:21.370
It's Lilith, your friendly neighborhood ancestor.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:25.200
I'm talking to you directly through your mind right now.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.290
Huh?

00:17:26.290 --> 00:17:29.200
You're in quite the pinch, I see.

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:33.950
However, for some reason your signal
is exceptionally strong today!

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.080
The magic inside of you is simply overflowing!

00:17:36.080 --> 00:17:37.500
Now is the perfect chance!

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:40.160
Call upon it! Your inner appearance!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.200
Sha...

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.160
Shami...

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:48.620
Shadow Mistress Yuko! Crisis Management Foooooorm!

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:54.660
Huh? My body just reacted on its own...

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:22.910
Huh?! What is this outfit...?

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.950
No, seriously, what the heck is this thing?

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:31.910
You said it yourself, it's your "Crisis Management Form."

00:18:31.910 --> 00:18:36.080
It's the result of my concept of a strong appearance
being linked directly to your consciousness.

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:38.410
Are you telling me that this is my battle form?

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:40.620
I want a retake!

00:18:40.620 --> 00:18:43.410
I can't walk around town
in a skimpy and embarrassing outfit like this!

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:45.870
In fact, my stomach already feels like it's freezing!

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:46.750
Seriously?

00:18:46.910 --> 00:18:49.040
Aren't you being just a little too self-conscious?

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.750
I don't think it's all that embarrassing.

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:53.450
A-are you sure?

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:55.450
Let's go for a walk.

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:57.620
Oh, hello th-

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.120
H-hello there...

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:02.870
Hello...

00:19:07.870 --> 00:19:08.540
Uhh...

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:12.290
I knew it, this outfit makes people do a double-take.

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:13.790
Ah, I see...

00:19:13.790 --> 00:19:16.620
Well, times have certainly changed
since the Mesopotamia era.

00:19:16.620 --> 00:19:18.540
Sorry about that, I'll fix it.

00:19:19.290 --> 00:19:21.080
DON'T FORGET
THE GOAL STILL LIES AHEAD

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:26.540
YOSHIDA

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.700
I'm glad I was able to return
to my normal form right away.

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:26.540
Today sure was a challenge.

00:19:26.540 --> 00:19:27.660
I'm home!

00:19:36.160 --> 00:19:37.910
Stinky, stinky!

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:44.660
Stinky, stinky! Stinky, stinky!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.450
Ms. Ancestor?

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.160
Oh crap, my ancestor fell into the garbage!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:49.040
Oh my gosh, are you all right?

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:52.250
I feel like my head is spinning...

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.250
I'm so sorry.

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:56.250
It's fine, you should check
and make sure everything else is okay.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:57.790
That's right! The laptop!

00:19:57.790 --> 00:20:00.120
Sis! I heard a loud crash!

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.080
Oh nooooooo!
Did you get hurt?

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:04.160
Huh?

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:07.000
That... that bag...

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.330
Momo's laptop is inside there.

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:11.120
She said she was lending it to you.

00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:13.040
Huh? Ms. Momo's laptop?

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.830
This is bad. I think I stepped on it!

00:20:16.500 --> 00:20:19.660
Even before that, I accidentally
let it drop with a solid "thud."

00:20:19.660 --> 00:20:21.620
Are you all right, Yuko?

00:20:21.620 --> 00:20:23.660
Come on, wrap a cold towel
around where you hurt yoursel-

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.540
Oh crap!

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.370
Get a cloth! Get a cloth!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.450
Gotta hurry! Gotta hurry!

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:34.290
What a mess! What a mess!

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.200
Gotta hurry! Gotta hurry!

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:41.830
I let my guard down. I forget that even after I get home,
there are still many dangers to avoid.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:44.250
SQUISH

00:20:44.250 --> 00:20:47.330
Wah! It feels soft and weird!

00:20:47.410 --> 00:20:50.450
What's up with this laptop?!
It's all squishy on the outside!

00:20:50.580 --> 00:20:52.120
Stinky, stinky!

00:20:52.120 --> 00:20:55.580
Gah! My ancestor went into the garbage again!

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:57.580
AND FINALLY

00:21:02.080 --> 00:21:03.120
It turned on!

00:21:04.080 --> 00:21:05.200
A letter?

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:07.160
Dear Shamiko,

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:09.790
I thought there was a good chance
that you would fall on your way home.

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:17.330
Dear Shamiko,
There was a good chance that you would fall on your way home.
 That's why I added a waterproof finish
and put it in a bag that can handle strong shocks.

00:21:10.080 --> 00:21:13.830
That's why I added a waterproof finish
and put it in a bag that can handle strong shocks.

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:20.540
So, it's probably not broken.
Even if it is, I can fix it myself. Don't worry about it.

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:20.290
So, it's probably not broken. Even if it is, I can fix it myself.
Don't worry about it.
From: Momo

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:21.500
From Momo.

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:24.160
P.S. Don't cry! Stay strong!

00:21:25.410 --> 00:21:29.410
Grr... Don't think this means you've won!

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:34.000
Oh yes, Shamiko! Even now, Lilith is diligently working
to create your other new transformations!

00:21:37.330 --> 00:21:40.750
Now that I have a camera,
it's time for take two of your interview!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:43.370
I'm Yuko Yoshida, 15 years old.

00:21:43.660 --> 00:21:46.000
Please tell me your most important goal right now.

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:51.620
My most important goal right now is to save some money
to buy a doughnut shaped pillow!

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.450
Because my horns really start to hurt when I sleep!

00:21:57.450 --> 00:22:00.330
Ryo really is the world's greatest sister.

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:02.620
Are you sure you two are okay with that?

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:06.910
"Incredible performance"...

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:09.450
You're doing that to make fun of me, I can tell!

00:22:09.450 --> 00:22:11.250
I won't let you read it, Momo!

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:14.000
But I have the data at home anyway...

00:22:14.750 --> 00:22:18.700
D-don't think this means you've won!

00:22:22.500 --> 00:22:34.040
The Demon Girl Next Door

00:22:39.870 --> 00:22:41.250
Sassouto shobu shite

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:42.790
Yatchau kedo makechatte

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:44.000
Fugainai nai ne

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:45.540
Shoushin tenshin

00:22:45.620 --> 00:22:46.950
Kibun wa sunsun demo

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.620
Shippo de henji shiyou

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:52.410
Chounai de waiwai shite

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:54.000
Inu made bow-wow de

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:55.290
Tende meimei de

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:56.750
Shunka shuutou

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:00.040
Shippai shita tte waraitobasou

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:06.540
Ano koro to onaji you ni kokoro tsumuide

00:23:06.950 --> 00:23:12.370
Kono machi de deaeta kiseki

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:19.120
Kanaete yo

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:21.910
Zenkai da wa tire shou ippai

00:23:21.910 --> 00:23:24.700
Warning mada kikikanri enjoy

