Toridori saita iro canvas kakenuke

00:23:30.250 --> 00:23:33.120
Sunset da wa, kangaete bakari ja

00:23:33.120 --> 00:23:35.370
Sou, mae!

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:40.120
Hora, donna iro datte yume kasanete

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:41.910
Motto asobou ne

00:23:51.000 --> 00:24:06.040
Preview

00:23:51.540 --> 00:23:54.660
Today I was able to accomplish something befitting
of an older sister for Ryo,

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:56.160
and on top of it all, I actually transformed, what a shock!

00:23:56.160 --> 00:23:57.330
Shamiko? Did something happen?

00:23:57.330 --> 00:24:00.580
I don't really understand it myself,
so let's just move on to the preview.

00:24:00.580 --> 00:24:02.500
In the next episode, I'm going to invade

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:06.040
Courage to Face the Future!! The Heavy Roller Won't Stop

00:24:02.500 --> 00:24:04.370
Momo's dreams and Momo's house, among other things.

00:24:04.370 --> 00:24:05.120
Now is the time!

00:24:05.120 --> 00:24:06.000
That sounds suspicious...
